WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The woman continues to read her book while sitting on a wooden bench in the park.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
The woman is now drawing on paper while sitting on the wooden bench.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
The man in red track pants picks up his phone from his bag.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
The man in a gray shirt with red stripes puts on earphones while standing next to the bench.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
The man in athletic wear adjusts his earphones while standing next to a bench with a backpack.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
The man in a gray shirt stretches his leg while the woman continues to read her book.

00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
A man walks past a woman who is sitting on a bench.

00:56.000 --> 01:04.000
A man in headphones sits on a bench reading a book while another person reads nearby.

01:04.000 --> 01:12.000
A man sits on a bench with headphones on, holding a water bottle, while a woman draws nearby with a pencil.

01:12.000 --> 01:20.000
The man holds something close to the woman's face as they sit in a forested area.

01:20.000 --> 01:28.000
A woman in a white lace dress sits on a bench with her eyes closed, next to a man who appears lost in thought.

01:28.000 --> 01:36.000
The man in a gray shirt drinks water from a bottle while the woman with blonde hair keeps her eyes closed.

01:36.000 --> 01:44.000
The man listens intently as the woman looks down with her eyes still closed.

01:44.000 --> 01:52.000
The man in a blue shirt sits next to the woman with blonde hair, who is now reading a book.

01:52.000 --> 02:00.000
A man in a gray shirt stands beside a woman with long blonde hair, who sits on a bench holding an open book.

02:00.000 --> 02:08.000
The man in a gray shirt walks away from the woman with long blonde hair, who remains seated on the bench reading.

02:08.000 --> 02:16.000
A woman with blonde hair sits on a bench drawing herself while someone runs past her.

02:16.000 --> 02:24.000
A woman with blonde hair sits on a wooden bench reading a book while wearing a sleeveless top and shorts, with a backpack next to her.

02:24.000 --> 02:32.000
The woman in a dress now sits on the bench reading while wearing sandals.

02:32.000 --> 02:40.000
A person stands in a park with trees, wearing headphones and looking up.

02:40.000 --> 02:48.000
The person now reads a handwritten note while sitting on a bench in the park.

02:48.000 --> 02:56.000
The man rubs his forehead while holding a piece of paper.

02:56.000 --> 03:04.000
The person sits with their hand on their face, looking up at a tree in front of them.

03:04.000 --> 03:12.000
The person stands with their eyes closed, holding a piece of paper.

03:12.000 --> 03:20.000
The person stands in a forest, reading or writing on a piece of paper held in their left hand.

03:20.000 --> 03:28.000
A man in a white shirt stands next to a woman with long hair wearing a red dress, who holds a camera. Nearby is another person carrying a backpack.

03:28.000 --> 03:36.000
The person stands in front of a screen displaying white text that reads "Starring Younes Mohamed & Diana Von Gruning" with additional thanks to Nizar Khammash.

03:36.000 --> 03:42.055
The person stands in front of a black background, wearing a dark-colored shirt or jacket.
